        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A long-term investment simulation spanning from 1996 to the present</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apes Ticker uses virtual data modeled on historical market flows, allowing you to directly experience market fluctuations while enjoying the challenge of investment strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday decisions affect not only your assets but also your lifestyle and condition, demanding both long-term vision and moment-to-moment choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin as a novice investor in 1996. Study and trade across diverse asset classes—stocks, foreign exchange, commodities, and real estate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure extra cash through part-time jobs when needed, or rely on the advice of fund managers to make bold decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: overwork raises stress, which may require hospital visits. Proper rest and travel become essential factors for long-term success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994750/extras/681ceb52664cc4ea96fe1b159508d697.avif?t=1761719384\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical events and cycles are reflected as price fluctuations, offering the thrill of reading capital flows through chart analysis.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994750/extras/89f34ca633f60a85d9569ddf9846e5a7.avif?t=1761719384\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advance the calendar one day at a time, balancing trading, analysis, rest, and part-time work. Your allocation of time and capital will shape your cumulative returns.</strong>  <br>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994750/extras/af92d86fe6c53e98aa9810072bebb53f.avif?t=1761719384\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go beyond stock trading—explore currency fluctuations, bulk commodity trades, and real estate flipping or rental to diversify your portfolio.</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994750/extras/208d91665fa2ab13fe532ce63bf67bd9.avif?t=1761719384\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy and sell houses for capital gains, or establish stable cash flow through rentals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhance properties with better furnishings to increase rental income.</strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994750/extras/204285de68890a5c9004e9e37cb1cfdb.avif?t=1761719384\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consult experts or entrust your funds for management. High returns may await, but so do risks—requiring a balance between caution and boldness.</strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994750/extras/d122f3511de0d551e6ae47839a6b0c28.avif?t=1761719384\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Part-time jobs provide safety funds, but overwork harms your condition. Stress buildup may require hospital visits, while timely vacations can sometimes be the best “investment” of all.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apes Ticker</strong> is inspired by historical market flows, allowing you to experience the mindset and routine of long-term investors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride the waves of the market while managing your lifestyle and condition, and feel the power of compounding over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting in 1996 and continuing to the present, the process of designing and growing your portfolio with your own strategy is the core thrill of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recommended Players</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who want to experience an investment simulation inspired by historical markets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who wish to expand their portfolio beyond stocks into forex, commodities, and real estate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone who enjoys combining lifestyle/resource management with long-term strategic planning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start in the past, live through the present, and design your future. Your time is your capital.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A long-term investment simulation spanning from 1996 to the present</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apes Ticker uses virtual data modeled on historical market flows, allowing you to directly experience market fluctuations while enjoying the challenge of investment strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday decisions affect not only your assets but also your lifestyle and condition, demanding both long-term vision and moment-to-moment choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin as a novice investor in 1996. Study and trade across diverse asset classes—stocks, foreign exchange, commodities, and real estate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure extra cash through part-time jobs when needed, or rely on the advice of fund managers to make bold decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: overwork raises stress, which may require hospital visits. Proper rest and travel become essential factors for long-term success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994750/extras/681ceb52664cc4ea96fe1b159508d697.avif?t=1761719384\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical events and cycles are reflected as price fluctuations, offering the thrill of reading capital flows through chart analysis.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994750/extras/89f34ca633f60a85d9569ddf9846e5a7.avif?t=1761719384\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advance the calendar one day at a time, balancing trading, analysis, rest, and part-time work. Your allocation of time and capital will shape your cumulative returns.</strong>  <br>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994750/extras/af92d86fe6c53e98aa9810072bebb53f.avif?t=1761719384\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go beyond stock trading—explore currency fluctuations, bulk commodity trades, and real estate flipping or rental to diversify your portfolio.</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994750/extras/208d91665fa2ab13fe532ce63bf67bd9.avif?t=1761719384\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy and sell houses for capital gains, or establish stable cash flow through rentals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhance properties with better furnishings to increase rental income.</strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994750/extras/204285de68890a5c9004e9e37cb1cfdb.avif?t=1761719384\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consult experts or entrust your funds for management. High returns may await, but so do risks—requiring a balance between caution and boldness.</strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994750/extras/d122f3511de0d551e6ae47839a6b0c28.avif?t=1761719384\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Part-time jobs provide safety funds, but overwork harms your condition. Stress buildup may require hospital visits, while timely vacations can sometimes be the best “investment” of all.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apes Ticker</strong> is inspired by historical market flows, allowing you to experience the mindset and routine of long-term investors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride the waves of the market while managing your lifestyle and condition, and feel the power of compounding over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting in 1996 and continuing to the present, the process of designing and growing your portfolio with your own strategy is the core thrill of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recommended Players</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who want to experience an investment simulation inspired by historical markets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who wish to expand their portfolio beyond stocks into forex, commodities, and real estate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone who enjoys combining lifestyle/resource management with long-term strategic planning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start in the past, live through the present, and design your future. Your time is your capital.</strong></p>",
